{
  "title": "Namaz of Imam Mahdi (a.t.f.s.)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "This prayer consists of two units in each of which Surah al-Faatehah is recited once but the following Ayah (verse) is repeated one hundred times:\nاِيَّاكَ نَعْبُدُ وَ اِيَّاكَ نَسْتَعِيْنُ\nIYYAAKA NA’BODO WA IYYAAKA NASTA-E’EN. \nThee do we serve and Thee do we beseech for help. \nThen, Surah al-Tawheed is recited once."
}
